.TH strarray_dump 3
.SH NAME
strarray_dump \- debug dump of a string array
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B #include "strarray.h"
.PP
.BI "void strarray_dump(buffer *" b ", const strarray *" arr ");"
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B strarray_dump
writes a human-readable dump of the string array
.I arr
to the buffer
.IR b ,
showing index and string value for each element.